    <node id="&quot;ACHADA FURNA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Achada Furna is a settlement in the southern part of the island of Fogo, Cape Verde, situated 15 km east of the island capital São Filipe. It has a population of 1,234 at the 2010 census and an elevation of about 870 meters."&lt;SEP&gt;"Achada Furna is a settlement in the southern part of the island of Fogo, Cape Verde, situated 15 km east of the island capital São Filipe. It has a population of 495 at the 2010 census and an elevation of about 870 meters."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0254-625ff1f99c77</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SÃO FILIPE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"São Filipe is the capital of the island of Fogo, Cape Verde, located 15 km west of Achada Furna."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0254-625ff1f99c77</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CAPE VERDE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Cape Verde is a country where the island of Brava is located."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cape Verde is an island nation in the Atlantic Ocean, home to the island of Fogo where Achada Furna is located."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0254-625ff1f99c77</data>
    </node>
